# Everything is text; let each checkout use its native line ending.
* text=auto

# Go sources stay LF so `gofmt -l .` (a mandatory pre-commit check) agrees on
# every platform: CRLF working copies make gofmt report every file.
*.go text eol=lf

# Goldens are compared byte for byte (key order, spacing and line endings are
# all significant), so git must never rewrite their bytes on checkout. This
# must come after `* text=auto`: the last matching pattern wins.
testdata/golden/** -text
